        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quiz Meets Combat</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every question is a battle opportunity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Correct answer = Fire energy rays</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies = Restore memory energy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Higher combo = Larger attack range</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Rhythm</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies keep coming, testing your reaction speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wrong answers cost memory energy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zero memory = Game over</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn under pressure, grow in battle</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rich Learning Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built-in Classic Texts</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📜 <strong>Poetry</strong>: Tang and Song dynasty classics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📖 <strong>Tao Te Ching</strong>: Laozi's philosophical masterpiece</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>More Content</strong>: Continuously updated</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Learning</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📊 Import Excel data sources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📝 Custom chapters and content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎓 Suitable for various learning needs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👨‍🏫 Teachers can create teaching materials</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Difficulty Settings</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎚️ <strong>7 Difficulty Levels</strong>: 0%, 10%, 20%, 30%, 50%, 80%, 100%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📊 <strong>Missing Character Rate</strong>: Higher difficulty = more missing characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔄 <strong>Chapter Repeat</strong>: Reinforce memory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📝 <strong>Sentence Repeat</strong>: Fine practice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💡 <strong>Pinyin Hints</strong>: Learning assistance</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who Should Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Learners interested in Chinese traditional culture<br>✅ Casual players who enjoy light action games<br>✅ Sci-fi enthusiasts seeking visual effects<br>✅ Indie game players appreciating innovative gameplay<br>✅ Educators needing teaching assistance tools<br>✅ Parents choosing educational games for children</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌟 <strong>Innovative Gameplay</strong> - Perfect blend of quiz and shooting<br>🎨 <strong>Visual Spectacle</strong> - Complete sci-fi holographic visual system<br>📚 <strong>Cultural Heritage</strong> - Learn Chinese classics through gaming<br>🎯 <strong>Deep Progression</strong> - Chip, achievement, and title systems<br>🔧 <strong>Free Customization</strong> - Support custom learning content<br>🌐 <strong>Multi-language</strong> - Full Chinese and English support</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quiz Meets Combat</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every question is a battle opportunity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Correct answer = Fire energy rays</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies = Restore memory energy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Higher combo = Larger attack range</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Rhythm</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies keep coming, testing your reaction speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wrong answers cost memory energy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zero memory = Game over</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn under pressure, grow in battle</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rich Learning Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built-in Classic Texts</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📜 <strong>Poetry</strong>: Tang and Song dynasty classics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📖 <strong>Tao Te Ching</strong>: Laozi's philosophical masterpiece</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>More Content</strong>: Continuously updated</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Learning</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📊 Import Excel data sources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📝 Custom chapters and content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎓 Suitable for various learning needs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👨‍🏫 Teachers can create teaching materials</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Difficulty Settings</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎚️ <strong>7 Difficulty Levels</strong>: 0%, 10%, 20%, 30%, 50%, 80%, 100%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📊 <strong>Missing Character Rate</strong>: Higher difficulty = more missing characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔄 <strong>Chapter Repeat</strong>: Reinforce memory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📝 <strong>Sentence Repeat</strong>: Fine practice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💡 <strong>Pinyin Hints</strong>: Learning assistance</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who Should Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Learners interested in Chinese traditional culture<br>✅ Casual players who enjoy light action games<br>✅ Sci-fi enthusiasts seeking visual effects<br>✅ Indie game players appreciating innovative gameplay<br>✅ Educators needing teaching assistance tools<br>✅ Parents choosing educational games for children</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌟 <strong>Innovative Gameplay</strong> - Perfect blend of quiz and shooting<br>🎨 <strong>Visual Spectacle</strong> - Complete sci-fi holographic visual system<br>📚 <strong>Cultural Heritage</strong> - Learn Chinese classics through gaming<br>🎯 <strong>Deep Progression</strong> - Chip, achievement, and title systems<br>🔧 <strong>Free Customization</strong> - Support custom learning content<br>🌐 <strong>Multi-language</strong> - Full Chinese and English support</p>",
